        "id": "zeratul",
        "name": "Zeratul"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "As a frail Ranged Assassin, Valla tends to naturally struggle against other high-damage Assassins who have the ability to effectively gap close past her Vault's range or otherwise sneak up on her (such has Zeratul). With little in the way of self-peeling, make sure to stay near your Healer when possible against such Heroes, and make no bold attempts at outplaying your opponents."
  },
